    "name": "EscapeTheBrainrots",
    "steam_appid": 3781690,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781690/extras/ba91bf7bf5446d5545a9c49bf2bc98b3.avif?t=1751045093\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server to follow game updates, meet other players, suggest ideas, and be part of the Brainrot-hunting community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the weird ideas behind the game actually come from that server it\u2019s the brain hub of the operation. Get in, and become an official anti-Brainrot unit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Brainrots</strong> is a local co-op horror game for up to 4 players, mixing <strong>chaos</strong>, <strong>absurd humor</strong>, and <strong>twisted mechanics</strong>.<br>You play as an AI deployed to Earth to neutralize the <i>Italian Brainrots</i>\u00a0unstable beings born from human stupidity. Every map features a new Brainrot with its own gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sahur</strong> chases you... then stops to quiz you mid-sprint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patapim</strong> plays deadly Red Light, Green Light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are coming soon even worse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round feels like a cursed cartoon mixed with a cracked escape room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in local co-op with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to trigger laughs, panic, betrayal, and debate over dumb quiz questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're escaping Sahur or arguing about what color he was two minutes ago every match is chaos in motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>SURVIVE (OR DIE TRYING)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough, and the Brainrot starts to weaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught? You're done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it far enough? The roles reverse and now <strong>you</strong> get to hunt them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude08 <strong>BRAINROTS YOU\u2019LL NEVER FORGET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TungTung Sahur, Patapim, Brr Brr\u2026 and more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Brainrot has a personality, voice, and unique gameplay twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may look silly, but don\u2019t let that fool you they\u2019re chaotic, cruel, and deeply entertaining.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781690/extras/ba91bf7bf5446d5545a9c49bf2bc98b3.avif?t=1751045093\" data-has-big width=800 height=532 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc49 <strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD SERVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server to follow game updates, meet other players, suggest ideas, and be part of the Brainrot-hunting community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the weird ideas behind the game actually come from that server it\u2019s the brain hub of the operation. Get in, and become an official anti-Brainrot unit.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape the Brainrots</strong> is a local co-op horror game for up to 4 players, mixing <strong>chaos</strong>, <strong>absurd humor</strong>, and <strong>twisted mechanics</strong>.<br>You play as an AI deployed to Earth to neutralize the <i>Italian Brainrots</i>\u00a0unstable beings born from human stupidity. Every map features a new Brainrot with its own gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sahur</strong> chases you... then stops to quiz you mid-sprint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patapim</strong> plays deadly Red Light, Green Light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others are coming soon even worse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round feels like a cursed cartoon mixed with a cracked escape room.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>PLAY WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in local co-op with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is designed to trigger laughs, panic, betrayal, and debate over dumb quiz questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're escaping Sahur or arguing about what color he was two minutes ago every match is chaos in motion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>SURVIVE (OR DIE TRYING)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive long enough, and the Brainrot starts to weaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get caught? You're done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it far enough? The roles reverse and now <strong>you</strong> get to hunt them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\ude08 <strong>BRAINROTS YOU\u2019LL NEVER FORGET</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TungTung Sahur, Patapim, Brr Brr\u2026 and more to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Brainrot has a personality, voice, and unique gameplay twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may look silly, but don\u2019t let that fool you they\u2019re chaotic, cruel, and deeply entertaining.</p>",
